OL,3,GNEWSADelays on A1(M) after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A1(M) was closed after a
OL,7,Fmulti-vehicle crash.
OL,9,FThe northbound carriageway was shut at
OL,10,Fjunction eight for Stevenage in
OL,11,FHertfordshire.
OL,13,FIt has since reopened but there have
OL,14,Fstill been delays of 20 minutes and two
OL,15,Fmiles of congestion on the approach.
OL,17,FTraffic had been diverted via the exit
OL,18,Fand entry slip roads as all emergency
OL,19,Fservices attended the scene, National
OL,20,FHighways said.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
